;
; Module definition for Ribble (plan.txt section 5).
; No DESCRIPTION field.  The BLDLEVEL string lives in mainwin.cpp.

NAME        Ribble WINDOWAPI

DATA        LOADONCALL MULTIPLE NONSHARED
CODE        LOADONCALL

STACKSIZE   0x10000
HEAPSIZE    0x1000